WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.100
There are many things "The Batman" gets right
about its title character.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.880
So what's the deal with that super-slow walk?

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.620
Keep watching to find out.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.700
Heads up — spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.280
The Caped Crusader begins the film as a terrifying
creature of the night, instilling fear into

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.640
the hearts of criminals and everyday citizens
alike.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.820
"Fear is a tool."

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.440
However, he realizes he needs to be more than
that by the end of the movie.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:27.800
He needs to be a symbol of hope as much as
fear.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.580
Another aspect the film does exceptionally
well is establishing Bruce Wayne as the world's

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.079
greatest detective, as he's often referred
to in the comics.

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:38.390
He walks slowly around crime scenes, taking
in every detail.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:43.440
And when he receives his first card from Riddler,
he's able to solve the riddle fairly quickly.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.780
He's met his intellectual match, but before
he can bring Riddler to justice, he'll go

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.820
through the physical and emotional wringer
to realize what he needs to become to stop

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.820
him.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:53.820
"I'm vengeance."

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:57.829
It's unlike any other Batman film that's come
before, and some of the changes to the character

00:00:57.829 --> 00:01:01.000
and setting have some fans scratching their
heads.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.720
One of the most significant changes involves
the speed at which Batman enters a crime scene

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:09.640
— many viewers have noted he walks exceptionally
slowly entering a room.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:13.659
This has caused quite a stir on social media,
particularly on Reddit.

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:18.000
However, many fans have chimed in with their
own theories as to why this Batman is slower

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.659
than what we've seen on the big screen before.

00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:22.799
One Reddit user posted a meme reading,

00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:27.330
"Batman in this movie walks slowly when entering
crime scenes so that his lens can record and

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:29.899
identify details with greater clarity."

00:01:29.899 --> 00:01:34.030
One of the newest gadgets Batman sports in
the new movie is a pair of high-tech contact

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:37.360
lenses that record everything the user looks
at.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.770
It allows Bruce to review the footage at a
later time so he can focus on small details

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:44.290
he and the cops may have missed the first
time around.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:48.830
He also gives the lenses to Selina Kyle at
one point so that he can look at the clientele

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.399
deep within Penguin's club.

00:01:50.399 --> 00:01:54.119
In fact, the same Reddit user made a great
connection, stating,

00:01:54.119 --> 00:01:58.960
"This is also shown canonically when he requests
Selina to move around a bit slower as he's

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.360
tracking everyone's face inside the lounge."

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:04.540
Of course, others suggest the slow walking
goes even deeper.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:05.979
A different Reddit user wrote,

00:02:05.979 --> 00:02:11.280
"It also makes him seem even more inhuman
and unnatural lends to his terror hero status."

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:15.690
Both explanations ring true, and it just goes
to show the level of detail director Matt

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:18.150
Reeves went into crafting a realistic world.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:22.480
"The first conversation I had with Matt about
it, I just knew there was something radically

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.510
different from anything we'd seen in Batman
movies before."

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:29.340
Throughout his existence, Batman has always
sported an array of gadgets to help him out

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.340
of a bind.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:33.820
He may not have superpowers, but he has plenty
of help in other ways.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:37.890
In "The Batman," he has a few familiar gadgets,
but there are some new items, as well, that

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.060
assist him when he needs them most.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:44.720
Arguably, the most important gadget he has
at his disposal outside of the contact lenses

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.210
is the liquid he injects himself with during
the final battle with Riddler's henchmen.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:52.490
It's never established what precisely the
substance is.

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:56.890
Some believe it was a mere adrenaline shot
Batman uses whenever he's too beaten and bruised

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.730
to continue on his own.

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:02.720
Others think it was a variation of Bane's
Venom, either establishing that Bane already

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.800
exists in this universe or that he could potentially
come up down the road.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.060
One of the Reddit users in the latter category
said,

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.670
"I'm glad I wasn't the only one who noticed
the serum.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.820
I think they're setting up for Bane.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:17.260
His reaction to it was very reminiscent of
how Bane would react."

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:21.240
While much of his gear has been seen in other
iterations of the character, "The Batman"

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.940
adds some intriguing wrinkles here and there
to make the machines more practical to this

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.150
particular version.

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:30.820
For instance, Batman has seemingly always
had a grappling gun, but this version springs

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:33.360
out of his arm for quick and easy access.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:37.370
Perhaps another reason why Batman walks slowly
is due to all the gear he has to carry around

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:38.370
with him!

